  data: {
    LLM: 'All players sit in a circle with four cards each. Everyone simultaneously passes one card face down to the left and picks up the card from the right. There are no turns; passing continues as fast as players wish. You must pass one card before picking up the next; you may never hold more than four cards. When a player collects four of a kind they quietly touch their nose. As soon as one player touches their nose, all others may do the same. The last player to touch their nose loses the round (is the Pig).',
    Player: 'All players sit in a circle with four cards each. Everyone simultaneously passes one card face down to the left and picks up the card from the right. There are no turns; passing continues as fast as players wish. You must pass one card before picking up the next; you may never hold more than four cards. When a player collects four of a kind they quietly touch their nose. As soon as one player touches their nose, all others may do the same. The last player to touch their nose loses the round (is the Pig).',
    objective: "Collect four cards of the same rank and be quick to react to others' completion.",
    gameplay: 'All players sit in a circle with four cards each. Everyone simultaneously passes one card face down to the left and picks up the card from the right. There are no turns; passing continues as fast as players wish. You must pass one card before picking up the next; you may never hold more than four cards. When a player collects four of a kind they quietly touch their nose. As soon as one player touches their nose, all others may do the same. The last player to touch their nose loses the round (is the Pig).',
